  "solution": "Given:\n\n(1.6×1.6×1.6-0.6×0.6×0.6)/(1.6×1.6+1.6×0.6+0.6×0.6)\n\nConcept used:\n\na3 - b3 = (a - b)(a2 + b2 + ab)\n\nCalculation:\n\n(1.6×1.6×1.6-0.6×0.6×0.6)/(1.6×1.6+1.6×0.6+0.6×0.6)\n\n⇒ (1.6³-0.6³)/(1.6²+1.6×0.6+0.6²)\n\n⇒ ((1.6-0.6)(1.6²+1.6×0.6+0.6²))/(1.6²+1.6×0.6+0.6²)\n\n⇒ 1.6 - 0.6\n\n⇒ 1\n\n∴ The required answer is 1.",
